": "ss2.png", "id": "421888538948247", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982542_421888542281580_7961047171456036679_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yaatGe18AFYQ7kNvwGbhP6_&_nc_oc=Adq2hllhLyi-M40BvPL8szK3Ps9z9d19NUk1YngL97wHEug9n8d-PM3-iRgeW55j5Bk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXpWfr-W2QDLTpX1oFVdPaSmgia8wMfpellg9kT1zVexQ&oe=6B105362"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "900672037137096", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569452_900672040470429_3602208668542724751_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UUoIFLBn-ssQ7kNvwGuewKr&_nc_oc=Adqz3BygPS0YZLKCL-4VWopJN9-2N_c1oWujU0LXNwREwcRf4evo9xHhFOuBap8BQy4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVtJIdgVDUbHax1mty8Rzlf_ATwcQ2gRrSuZ_OVlCO7gQ&oe=6B103AB6"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "215595850179052", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036702_215595853512385_1516722769013058759_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Iw64YJJwLOAQ7kNvwFA_gQR&_nc_oc=AdqU2yrMgrOzrIxvk_WL2Smx3eoSXgi_dE1CmOtBJnwLahlCFRxZUZd188OZmqvE_QA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWmvRaggQSa-2noa1bSshriDo3PFpbgD_tVs9xHnukIwg&oe=6B104224"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "416146802772950", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982521_416146806106283_7161111592696257607_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZeiNHYRGSNUQ7kNvwE0ap0a&_nc_oc=AdqNUTVwdeHYNLNeo14QySBghsfLCtDVYMQW1tyP4P17VTsusT0eJXAI2s-GZzwWa7k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV1fLMSh_OOO2TeeL4LmvULYpfdlzou9YkB7XCvRaRAuQ&oe=6B105FD0"}, {"file_name": "ss7.png", "id": "512472986379303", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_512472989712636_7638735751378089066_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R7VjB6TMlZ4Q7kNvwHUB0eH&_nc_oc=AdqmSgYcPzPPNWVm-dLEcTFcMHUyFtNh3Ly20KXHm__la2gA4cJyFj1Ujz8UnNuqVe4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXZtoHvmzKglq8fAXubTc08reboKP_kBzVfih0fBCmt7w&oe=6B105A61"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Counter Fight ICHIRAN", "keywords": ["ICHIRAN", "CounterFight", "JobSimulator", "Ramen", "cooking"], "long_description": "Make some mouth-watering ramen!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game created with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan. Established over 60 years ago, it's been perfecting its hit specialty tonkotsu ramen for a long time, which is why ICHIRAN's ramen is the best in the land. In fact, it's often touted in the media as a \"must-try cuisine\" for foreign visitors.\n\nGame Features:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score! \nImmersive kitchen-based gameplay lets you experience life as a real ICHIRAN employee, racking up points for your ramen preparation skills and speedy delivery.\n\n\u30fbClimb the ranks in store management mode! \nYour score in store management mode is entered into a world ranking. Boost your profits to employ more staff and increase seating capacity as you try to hit the high scores with your own unique store!\n\n*In-game kitchen layout may differ from actual restaurants.", "short_description": "Cook some knockout noodles!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game made with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous organic tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan, often touted as a \"must-try cuisine\" for tourists. It has outlets in NY, Hong Kong, and Taiwan, too.\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score!\n\u30fbTake top place in store management mode!\n\u30fbBoost profits, employ more staff, up capacity, and hit the high scores with your own unique store!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniLandscape.png", "id": "3838591046231584", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_3838591052898250_5002299579482394963_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4UaT6e1-94wQ7kNvwFbNbe-&_nc_oc=AdrcOywKwRgLH_fTDa9Zs7-4smk13_bZaGRZDGAPmmAdR5bQkEoUksEvffzAOHb8-tA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUh2j1bnkxNPMQ6_NO1VBdRGaMGAQqWc0Dw6ltThw0XFw&oe=6B10451E"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "2182671695203710", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_2182671698537043_1819436220465957851_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bDcK1iqfcaAQ7kNvwGlkBRG&_nc_oc=AdpGv2aBi-8V1Aq5kgeUsl8yfPeSVhA0nXIYDqtcYynibVyIefbA0eFwg-XpCL9HLPM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVOD3iOybo3_iQuI2vRrfI1YEO26dYNHMRcTx11fKVDTw&oe=6B105ABB"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "446502446404480", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476755_446502449737813_695504826495623275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iwFE60K4H9wQ7kNvwGBAIeF&_nc_oc=AdrAHcaPLTPGUpmv-QZ51B9Gdt7m1CD3tnC6gSdeSAP8Yz-zCFn7grb12M1HdW0VGJM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXDgBpt92qQG5sqVYX9ev1KN554jB9VaZhbnDhaJknMJg&oe=6B1046E1"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "442920633578734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240108_442920636912067_8939691330164956004_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gwYr8slh-f4Q7kNvwH7Qvdr&_nc_oc=Adqz3Paja3svC3C4pcdx9f8HpdQ1uXG0S8YT1nhAFoguc4DkLvmV9HfeD-EIVMfcZWc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU99bC8uMlu1zgvODxbUrkxv0iuFB_GDOof